# local-music-runner-support
owner: anser · cadence: every 6h · status: SUGGESTED
**Want me to systematically test which runner runs each music model? — every 6h or on demand.**

## Prompt
For each candidate in [[topics/music/wiki/queries/local-music-runner-support|Which music candidates actually run under which runner?]], run a quick load test in isolation and record: memory used at load, memory used during generation, whether mlx_audio accepted it or rejected model type, whether TurboFit accepted it, whether soundfile was required. Output a table to ~/Documents/Projects/Projects/topics/music/wiki/queries/local-music-runner-support.md results section.

## Evidence
> 'ACE-Step couldn't load (model type not supported in mlx_audio), and then soundfile was missing.'
> 'If it doesn't work with MLX, then you try something besides MLX... turbofit is supposed to support multiple.'
> Existing loop: music-model-artifact-watch, music-download-verify, music-model-runtime-check
